/* @catalog — generated by `npm run catalog:generate`; do not edit by hand.
 * Internal
 *   Classes: Storage
 *   Functions: mutation, code, projects, stored, tagged, project, slotOf, upload, reconcile,
 *              preparingPublication, onNextProjectRead, png, image
 *   Constants: actor, other, by, byOther, shared, idle, quietLuna
 *   Variables: harness
 * Tests
 *   - a confirmed upload fills its title, Disc and Track Numbers from tags or a disc folder, counting only automatic writes
 *   - tag values with control or invisible formatting characters or over a limit are flagged and never reach the draft
 *   - once every file is confirmed one step fills the shared Album values and one primary entry, and replays, checks and re-uploads never repeat it
 *   - values the files disagree on stay empty, a placeholder album artist adds no entry, and a company-like one is flagged as a possible label
 *   - two final confirmations racing run the album step exactly once: the later run retries against the committed step and writes nothing more
 *   - the album step keeps markers a later release stored beside it
 *   - an administrator save wins over automation before, during and after a confirmation
 *   - an upload admitted inside the automation transaction meets no conflict, and both files are prefilled
 *   - decisions, cover selection and adoption are admitted at a revision from before uploads, Luna and automation, and stopping analysis at one from its analysis receipt; a renamed entry or label is stale
 *   - an approval built before automation changed a shown value is stale and writes nothing, while the current digest at an old revision is admitted
 *   - automation writes nothing during a publication lock or after the actor loses the role, and another administrator's check catches up
 *   - every publication lock keeps automation out, and after confirmed cleanup the original upload intent's replay catches up
 *   - a project in a newer draft format or with a malformed stored draft is never automated, while its upload keeps its own result
 *   - at the ordinary receipt limit a check still prefills, and automatic writes take no receipt of either kind
 *   - a project saved before tag evidence v2 is never automated or re-read, and a new upload after conversion fills only empty values
 *   - intents stored before bound names replay for every kind admitted at any revision, and new bodies without them ask for a reload
 *   - a decision set, cover choice or analysis stop built before another administrator changed what it binds is refused and writes nothing
 *   - analysis and staged cleanup bind the last administrator receipt, so upload transfers and Luna ticks never refuse them while another administrator's change does
 *   - a revision the project never had is refused for every kind, including those admitted at any earlier revision
 *   - a publication cancellation confirmed before publication-worker checkpoints is admitted, and one from before the approval is refused
 * @end-catalog */

/**
 * Tag evidence, automatic prefill and revision decoupling against a real replica set: confirmed uploads fill empty or automatic
 * values through compare-and-set, the album step runs once, administrator saves always win, automation takes no receipts and
 * never makes an administrator's decisions, cover choice, adoption, analysis stop or approval stale by itself. Storage is an
 * in-memory fake; all names, tags and identifiers are synthetic.
 */
